    "heading": "Resting",
    "lineStart": 739,
    "lineEnd": 741
  },
  "section": "1.90",
  "rulesText": "Adventurers can't spend every hour adventuring. They need rest. Any creature can take hour-long Short Rests in the midst of a day and an 8-hour Long Rest to end it. Regaining Hit Points is one of the main benefits of a rest. “Rules Glossary” provides the rules for Short and Long Rests."
}
